lass=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Morgan County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years. In 2025, April to May hit 165% of normal on the middle, while November to December fell to 74%. The 2026 year opened short, with February to March at 63% and March to April at 64% on the middle. Grid 21487 had its driest year in 1963 at 67%.</p>"}
